<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Terms on A Byte of Cybersecurity</title><link>https://lloydlore.github.io/categories/terms/</link><description>Recent content in Terms on A Byte of Cybersecurity</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 Nov 2024 23:59:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://lloydlore.github.io/categories/terms/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>工行融 e 行个人信息保护政策分析</title><link>https://lloydlore.github.io/posts/pii-analysis-for-icbc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 29 May 2023 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://lloydlore.github.io/posts/pii-analysis-for-icbc/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;本文尝试对工行融 e 行的个人信息保护政策做出一些分析，我尝试通过这些分析得出一些关键字。以作为其他分析时的参考。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="基于功能的数据和基于数据的功能"&gt;&#10; 基于功能的数据和基于数据的功能&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#%e5%9f%ba%e4%ba%8e%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd%e7%9a%84%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e5%92%8c%e5%9f%ba%e4%ba%8e%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e7%9a%84%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;从信息安全三位一体的角度上说，我们需要保护的一是服务，二是数据，即 Service &amp;amp; Data。在做个人信息识别，和资产识别时，可以分别从基于功能的数据和基于数据的功能的角度来展开。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>工行融 e 行个人信息保护政策</title><link>https://lloydlore.github.io/posts/a-pii-example-from-icbc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 May 2023 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://lloydlore.github.io/posts/a-pii-example-from-icbc/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;本文对原文做了个别修改，如需参考原文，见：&lt;a href="https://m.icbc.com.cn/ICBC/disclaimer/2.htm" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://m.icbc.com.cn/ICBC/disclaimer/2.htm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;我是工商银行的用户，前几天在使用该银行服务的时候，在手机端被提示了工商银行最新的个人信息保护政策。记录以下要点。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>What is Back Office?</title><link>https://lloydlore.github.io/posts/what-is-back-office/</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://lloydlore.github.io/posts/what-is-back-office/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="definition"&gt;&#10; Definition&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#definition"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The back office is a counter concept against front office.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description></item><item><title>What is Information Security Management</title><link>https://lloydlore.github.io/posts/what-is-information-security-management/</link><pubDate>Sun, 14 May 2023 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://lloydlore.github.io/posts/what-is-information-security-management/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Information security management validates that appropriate policies, procedures, standards, and guidelines are implemented to ensure business operations are conducted within an acceptable level of risk.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>